# Course graph: mapping new nodes

Edges come only from `[[wikilinks]]`. Structure beats convenience: never shortcut past a hub/category.

## Taxonomy (pick one tag + folder)

| Tag | Hub | Middle layer | Leaf |
|-----|-----|--------------|------|
| `lesson` | `01-Уроки/index` | — (flat under hub) | `Урок-*.md` |
| `homework` | `02-Домашні-завдання/index` | — | `ДЗ-*.md` |
| `materials` | `03-Матеріали/index` | Довідники / Бонус / SOCMINT / Промпти / Шаблони / Статті | page in that category |
| `project` | `05-Проєкти/index` | project `*/index` (TSUKUYOMI, Obsidian, Hermes…) | module pages |
| `case` | `06-Кейси/index` | category `*/index` (CTI, Шахрайство…) | case page |
| `meta` | home / literacy notes | — | rare |

Frontmatter: exactly one structural tag from the table (extra topical tags only if needed; they create global tag stars).

## Allowed edges

1. **Hub →** middle nodes only (categories / project folders / all lessons or ДЗ). Optional **hub ↔ hub** (e.g. Уроки↔ДЗ, Проєкти↔Кейси, Матеріали categories back to materials hub).
2. **Category →** its leaves + parent hub. List every leaf (no undocumented pages).
3. **Leaf →** parent only (category, or lesson/ДЗ hub if flat).
4. **Outside → hub** never to a leaf (home, other sections, course-nav “Матеріали/Кейси/…”).

### Intentional intersection (lessons ↔ homework only)

- Paired leaves may link: Урок ↔ ДЗ (01↔01, 02↔02, 04↔04, 07↔07, 08↔08 today).
- No prev/next chains between lessons or between ДЗ; order lives on the hub list.

## Adding a new page (checklist)

1. Choose tag + folder from the table.
2. Create the `.md` with that tag.
3. Add absolute wikilink on the **parent** index (`[[05-Проєкти/TSUKUYOMI/New|…]]` style — avoid bare relative names that resolve wrong).
4. Set leaf course-nav to the parent only, as a short student line (no “Хаб” / “Категорія” / “Навігація курсу” labels), e.g.  
   `> [[…/index|Name]]`  
   (lessons/ДЗ: hub + optional pair, e.g. `> [[01-Уроки/index|Усі уроки]] · [[02-Домашні-завдання/ДЗ-02-GenAI-для-аналітика|Домашнє завдання]]`).
5. Do **not** wikilink siblings, other sections’ leaves, or “related” pages in body — use plain text. TOC on overviews: backticks/filenames, not `[[leaf]]`.
6. Point home / foreign nav at the **section hub**, not the new leaf.
7. If you invent a new category: add `index.md` (tag + list of children + link to hub), then link it from the section hub — never hang leaves off the hub directly when a category exists.

## Anti-patterns

```markdown
<!-- BAD: hub skips to leaf -->
- [[06-Кейси/CTI/Кейс-CTI-приклад]]

<!-- GOOD -->
- [[06-Кейси/CTI/index|CTI]]

<!-- BAD: leaf mesh -->
> **Далі:** [[Урок-04]] · **Матеріали:** [[Матеріали-Урок-02-GenAI]]

<!-- GOOD -->
> [[01-Уроки/index|Усі уроки]] · [[02-Домашні-завдання/ДЗ-02-GenAI-для-аналітика|Домашнє завдання]]
```

## After edits

Confirm the new slug appears under its parent in the graph (no orphan, no clique). Reader-facing summary: `content/Як-читати-граф.md`.
